<view class="page page-shell">
  <view class="panel hero-panel">
    <view class="brand">房贷计算器</view>
    <view class="segment segment-row mode-segment">
      <view
        class="segment-item {{calcMode === 'new' ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-mode="new"
        bindtap="onCalcModeChange"
      >新贷款</view>
      <view
        class="segment-item {{calcMode === 'remaining' ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-mode="remaining"
        bindtap="onCalcModeChange"
      >已有贷款</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-mask" wx:if="{{showMethodTip}}" catchtouchmove="preventMove" bindtap="onHideMethodTip">
    <view class="tip-dialog" catchtap="preventMove">
      <view class="tip-title">还款方式说明</view>
      <view class="tip-summary">等额本息月供稳定，等额本金利息更少</view>
      <view class="tip-block">
        <view class="tip-name">等额本息</view>
        <view class="tip-text">每月还款金额固定不变。前期利息占比较高、本金占比较低，后期逐渐变为还本金为主。适合收入稳定、希望月供压力平稳的用户。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip-block">
        <view class="tip-name">等额本金</view>
        <view class="tip-text">每月偿还的本金固定，利息随剩余本金逐月减少，因此月供会越来越少，总利息通常也更少，但前期还款压力更大。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip-block">
        <view class="tip-name">先息后本</view>
        <view class="tip-text">贷款期内每月只偿还利息，到期时一次性偿还全部本金。前期月供压力较小，但到期需准备较大一笔本金。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip-confirm" bindtap="onHideMethodTip">我知道了</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-mask" wx:if="{{showRemainingTip}}" catchtouchmove="preventMove" bindtap="onHideRemainingTip">
    <view class="tip-dialog" catchtap="preventMove">
      <view class="tip-title">剩余贷款参数说明</view>
      <view class="tip-text tip-single">知道当前执行利率可直接填写；不知道则从银行 App 抄录最近一次还款本金、利息与剩余本金</view>
      <view class="tip-confirm" bindtap="onHideRemainingTip">我知道了</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-mask" wx:if="{{showLprTip}}" catchtouchmove="preventMove" bindtap="onHideLprTip">
    <view class="tip-dialog" catchtap="preventMove">
      <view class="tip-title">LPR 基准利率</view>
      <view class="tip-block">
        <view class="tip-name">最新报价</view>
        <view class="tip-text">1年期 LPR：{{lpr.oneYear}}%</view>
        <view class="tip-text">5年期以上 LPR：{{lpr.fiveYear}}%</view>
        <view class="tip-text">公布日期：{{lpr.publishedAt}}</view>
        <view class="tip-text" wx:if="{{lprLoading}}">正在查询最新数据…</view>
        <view class="tip-text" wx:elif="{{lprError}}">{{lprError}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip-block">
        <view class="tip-name">什么是 LPR</view>
        <view class="tip-text">LPR（贷款市场报价利率）是银行发放贷款的定价参考基准，由全国银行间同业拆借中心每月公布。房贷利率一般在「5年期以上 LPR」基础上加减基点确定。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip-confirm" bindtap="onHideLprTip">我知道了</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <scroll-view scroll-y class="form-scroll" enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
    <!-- 新贷款：还款方式 → 金额填写 → 贷款类型 -->
    <block wx:if="{{calcMode === 'new'}}">
      <view class="panel">
        <view class="section-title">贷款信息</view>

        <view class="inline-row first">
          <view class="inline-label-wrap">
            <text class="inline-label">还款方式</text>
            <view class="help-icon" catchtap="onShowMethodTip" aria-role="button" aria-label="还款方式说明">!</view>
          </view>
          <view class="segment segment-row">
            <view
              class="segment-item {{method === 'equalInterest' ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-method="equalInterest"
              bindtap="onMethodChange"
            >等额本息</view>
            <view
              class="segment-item {{method === 'equalPrincipal' ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-method="equalPrincipal"
              bindtap="onMethodChange"
            >等额本金</view>
            <view
              class="segment-item {{method === 'interestFirst' ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-method="interestFirst"
              bindtap="onMethodChange"
            >先息后本</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="sub-block" wx:if="{{showCommercial}}">
          <view class="sub-title">商业贷款</view>
          <view class="field">
            <text class="field-label">贷款金额</text>
            <view class="field-control">
              <input
                class="field-input"
                type="digit"
                value="{{commercialAmount}}"
                data-field="commercialAmount"
                bindinput="onInput"
                placeholder="请输入"
              />
              <text class="field-unit">万元</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="field">
            <text class="field-label">贷款年限</text>
            <view class="field-control">
              <input
                class="field-input"
                type="number"
                value="{{commercialYears}}"
                data-field="commercialYears"
                bindinput="onInput"
                placeholder="如 30"
              />
              <text class="field-unit">年</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="field">
            <text class="field-label">年利率</text>
            <view class="field-control">
              <input
                class="field-input"
                type="digit"
                value="{{commercialRate}}"
                data-field="commercialRate"
                bindinput="onInput"
                placeholder="如 3.45"
              />
              <text class="field-unit">%</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="sub-block" wx:if="{{showProvident}}">
          <view class="sub-title">公积金贷款</view>
          <view class="field">
            <text class="field-label">贷款金额</text>
            <view class="field-control">
              <input
                class="field-input"
                type="digit"
                value="{{providentAmount}}"
                data-field="providentAmount"
                bindinput="onInput"
                placeholder="请输入"
              />
              <text class="field-unit">万元</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="field">
            <text class="field-label">贷款年限</text>
            <view class="field-control">
              <input
                class="field-input"
                type="number"
                value="{{providentYears}}"
                data-field="providentYears"
                bindinput="onInput"
                placeholder="如 30"
              />
              <text class="field-unit">年</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="field">
            <text class="field-label">年利率</text>
            <view class="field-control">
              <input
                class="field-input"
                type="digit"
                value="{{providentRate}}"
                data-field="providentRate"
                bindinput="onInput"
                placeholder="如 2.85"
              />
              <text class="field-unit">%</text>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="inline-row">
          <text class="inline-label">贷款类型</text>
          <view class="segment segment-row">
            <view
              class="segment-item {{loanType === 'provident' ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-type="provident"
              bindtap="onLoanTypeChange"
            >公积金贷</view>
            <view
              class="segment-item {{loanType === 'commercial' ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-type="commercial"
              bindtap="onLoanTypeChange"
            >商贷</view>
            <view
              class="segment-item {{loanType === 'combo' ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-type="combo"
              bindtap="onLoanTypeChange"
            >组合贷款</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="inline-row">
          <view class="inline-label-wrap">
            <text class="inline-label">LPR 基准利率</text>
            <view class="help-icon" catchtap="onShowLprTip" aria-role="button" aria-label="LPR 基准利率说明">!</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <!-- 已有贷款：还款方式固定在滚动区顶部，参数与推算结果一起滑动 -->
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="panel">
        <view class="inline-row first">
          <view class="inline-label-wrap">
            <text class="inline-label">还款方式</text>
            <view class="help-icon" catchtap="onShowMethodTip" aria-role="button" aria-label="还款方式说明">!</view>
          </view>
          <view class="segment segment-row">
            <view
              class="segment-item {{method === 'equalInterest' ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-method="equalInterest"
              bindtap="onMethodChange"
            >等额本息</view>
            <view
              class="segment-item {{method === 'equalPrincipal' ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-method="equalPrincipal"
              bindtap="onMethodChange"
            >等额本金</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="panel remaining-form-panel">
        <view class="section-title-row">
          <view class="section-title">剩余贷款参数</view>
          <view class="help-icon" catchtap="onShowRemainingTip" aria-role="button" aria-label="剩余贷款参数说明">!</view>
        </view>

        <view class="field">
          <text class="field-label">首次贷款期限</text>
          <view class="field-control">
            <input
              class="field-input"
              type="number"
              value="{{originalYears}}"
              data-field="originalYears"
              bindinput="onRemainingInput"
              placeholder="如 30"
            />
            <text class="field-unit">年</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="field">
          <text class="field-label">首次还款日期</text>
          <view class="field-control">
            <picker mode="date" value="{{firstRepaymentDate}}" bindchange="onFirstDateChange">
              <view class="picker-value {{firstRepaymentDate ? '' : 'placeholder'}}">
                {{firstRepaymentDate || '请选择日期'}}
              </view>
            </picker>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="field">
          <text class="field-label">当前执行利率</text>
          <view class="field-control">
            <input
              class="field-input"
              type="digit"
              value="{{manualAnnualRate}}"
              data-field="manualAnnualRate"
              bindinput="onRemainingInput"
              placeholder="选填，知利率可填"
            />
            <text class="field-unit">%</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="field" wx:if="{{!hasManualRate}}">
          <text class="field-label">最近一次还款本金</text>
          <view class="field-control">
            <input
              class="field-input"
              type="digit"
              value="{{monthPrincipal}}"
              data-field="monthPrincipal"
              bindinput="onRemainingInput"
              placeholder="请输入"
            />
            <text class="field-unit">元</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="field" wx:if="{{!hasManualRate}}">
          <text class="field-label">最近一次还款利息</text>
          <view class="field-control">
            <input
              class="field-input"
              type="digit"
              value="{{monthInterest}}"
              data-field="monthInterest"
              bindinput="onRemainingInput"
              placeholder="请输入"
            />
            <text class="field-unit">元</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="field">
          <text class="field-label">剩余本金</text>
          <view class="field-control">
            <input
              class="field-input"
              type="digit"
              value="{{remainingPrincipal}}"
              data-field="remainingPrincipal"
              bindinput="onRemainingInput"
              placeholder="还完最近一期后余额"
            />
            <text class="field-unit">元</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="inline-row">
          <text class="inline-label">提前还款</text>
          <view class="segment segment-row">
            <view
              class="segment-item {{earlyRepayment ? '' : 'active'}}"
              data-enabled="0"
              bindtap="onEarlyRepaymentToggle"
            >否</view>
            <view
              class="segment-item {{earlyRepayment ? 'active' : ''}}"
              data-enabled="1"
              bindtap="onEarlyRepaymentToggle"
            >是</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <block wx:if="{{earlyRepayment}}">
          <view class="field">
            <text class="field-label">提前还款类型</text>
            <view class="field-control field-control-segment">
              <view class="segment segment-row compact-segment">
                <view
                  class="segment-item {{prepayType === 'full' ? 'active' : ''}}"
                  data-type="full"
                  bindtap="onPrepayTypeChange"
                >一次性还清</view>
                <view
                  class="segment-item {{prepayType === 'partial' ? 'active' : ''}}"
                  data-type="partial"
                  bindtap="onPrepayTypeChange"
                >部分提前还</view>
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>

          <view class="field" wx:if="{{prepayType === 'partial'}}">
            <text class="field-label">部分还款金额</text>
            <view class="field-control">
              <input
                class="field-input"
                type="number"
                value="{{prepayAmountWan}}"
                data-field="prepayAmountWan"
                bindinput="onPrepayAmountInput"
                placeholder="正整数"
              />
              <text class="field-unit">万元</text>
            </view>
          </view>

          <view class="field field-stack" wx:if="{{prepayType === 'partial'}}">
            <text class="field-label">调整方式</text>
            <view class="segment segment-wrap">
              <view
                class="segment-item {{adjustMode === 'shorten' ? 'active' : ''}}"
                data-mode="shorten"
                bindtap="onAdjustModeChange"
              >缩短年限，月供基本不变</view>
              <view
                class="segment-item {{adjustMode === 'reduce' ? 'active' : ''}}"
                data-mode="reduce"
                bindtap="onAdjustModeChange"
              >减少月供，年限不变</view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </block>

        <view class="derived-block">
          <view class="section-title">自动推算结果</view>

          <view class="derived-row" wx:if="{{!hasManualRate}}">
            <text class="derived-label">当前执行利率</text>
            <text class="derived-value">{{derivedReady ? derivedAnnualRate + '%' : '--'}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="derived-row">
            <text class="derived-label">剩余还款年</text>
            <text class="derived-value">{{derivedReady ? derivedRemainingYears + '年' : '--'}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="derived-hint" wx:if="{{derivedReady}}">剩余 {{derivedRemainingMonths}} 期</view>
          <view class="derived-hint warn" wx:elif="{{derivedMessage}}">{{derivedMessage}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <view class="form-scroll-spacer"></view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="footer-block">
    <button class="primary-btn" bindtap="onCalculate">开始计算</button>
    <view class="disclaimer">计算结果仅供参考，实际以银行审批为准</view>
  </view>
</view>
